OL,3,GNEWSAPolice release CCTV of missing
OL,4,ALillia's last sighting
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV footage showing the last known
OL,7,Fsighting of a missing 13-year-old girl
OL,8,Fhas been released by Greater Manchester
OL,9,FPolice (GMP).
OL,11,FLillia, from Bolton, was last seen by
OL,12,Fher family on 11 September. Officers
OL,13,Fsaid further inquiries identified a
OL,14,Fsighting of her at Manchester
OL,15,FPiccadilly bus station at 10:36 BST on
OL,16,F14 September.
OL,18,FPolice have handed out hundreds of
OL,19,Fleaflets and used an advertising van
OL,20,Fdisplaying her photograph in Piccadilly
OL,21,FGardens as they continue efforts to
OL,22,Ffind her.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
